WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.556
The 1990s.

00:00:01.556 --> 00:00:03.613
Scandals and Near-Secession.

00:00:03.613 --> 00:00:05.647
The Charlottetown Accord fails.

00:00:05.647 --> 00:00:11.284
The 1995 Quebec referendum comes within 54,000 votes of breaking apart Canada.

00:00:11.284 --> 00:00:16.738
The Somalia Affair exposes Canadian soldiers torturing and killing a Somali teenager.

00:00:16.738 --> 00:00:18.806
The Sponsorship Scandal begins.
